  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Liu Yonghao (Chinese: 刘永好; born 1952) is a businessman in agribusiness in China. He is the founder and chairman of New Hope, the biggest animal feed producer in China. He is also involved in banking. As of 2019, He was ranked the 19th richest in China by Forbes in China.",
